    "preamble": "Mohd. Akram vs The State Of Telangana on 19 January, 2021 Author: K. Lakshman Bench: K. Lakshman The Honourable Sri Justice K. Lakshman Writ Petition No.22346 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioner herein is accused No.2 in C.C. No.47 of 2020. The offences alleged against him are under Sections - 270 and 273 of IPC.",
    "arguments": "4. Learned counsel for the petitioner as well as the learned Government Pleader for Home would submit that the subject matter is squarely covered by a common order dated 27.08.2018 passed by the High Court of Judicature at Hyderabad for the State of Telangana and Andhra Pradesh in Crl.P.No.3731 of 2018 and batch, and placed copy of the said judgment for perusal.",
